00:57:19.090 --> 00:57:31.430
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who-- this is so weird. He kept pledging over and over to public radio, hoping that he was going to win a big stuffed doll, until he spent all his savings.

00:57:31.430 --> 00:57:35.330
<v Yvonne>Why didn't you stop me then, when I had a chance?

00:57:35.330 --> 00:58:23.440
